        "@value": "by deleting paragraph (a). Amendment of Schedule 1"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/30/eng@/~part_I__cl_24",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "24",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/30/eng@/~part_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Schedule 1 to the principal Act is amended by inserting after Part XIV the following Part: “Part XV 1. Notwithstanding Part I, income tax shall be charged for a specified year of assessment on the chargeable income of an approved individual under the Returning Expert Programme in respect of having or exercising employment with a person in Malaysia at the rate of 15 per cent on every ringgit of that chargeable income. 2. In this Part— (a) an approved individual and the specified year of assessment referred to in paragraph 1; and (b) where the individual has income from a source other than the employment referred to in paragraph 1 or where subsection 45(2) applies, the chargeable income of the individual referred to in that paragraph, shall be as determined by the Minister by rules made under this Act.”. Amendment of Schedule 4b"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/30/eng@/~part_I__cl_25",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "25",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/30/eng@/~part_I",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Paragraph 5 of Schedule 4b to the principal Act is amended by deleting the words “or 4a”. Amendment of Schedule 7a"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/30/eng@/~part_I__cl_26",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "26",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2011/30/eng@/~part_I__cl_26__para_a",
